# ==========================================================
# INTERNSHIELD CSCC — SECURE ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# ==========================================================
# 1. Copy this file to ".env"        ->  cp .env.example .env
# 2. Fill in the key(s) you actually have. You do NOT need both.
# 3. NEVER commit the real ".env" file — it is already in .gitignore.
#
# No key at all? The tool still works — it automatically falls back
# to Shell-GPT (if installed) and finally to a built-in offline
# advisor, so it never hard-crashes just because a key is missing.

# --- OpenAI (used by ai.default_provider: openai, or by "auto") ---
# Get a key at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY="sk-..."

# --- Anthropic / Claude (used by ai.default_provider: anthropic, or by "auto") ---
# Get a key at: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="sk-ant-..."

# --- AWS overrides (usually you don't need these — `aws configure` is preferred) ---
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID="your_access_key"
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY="your_secret_key"
# AWS_DEFAULT_REGION="us-east-1"
